            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Fisherman",
              "text": "Well. You are queen now, wife. The banisters are gold. The PIG has a footman. Surely — surely — this is enough?",
              "duration": 8.81,
              "pose": "shrug"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Ilsabill",
              "text": "I lay awake all night, husband, thinking what is left to want.",
              "duration": 4.97,
              "pose": "lean"
            },
            {
              "type": "line",
              "character": "Fisherman",
              "text": "…Nothing. Nothing is left. Say nothing is left.",
              "duration": 3.43,
              "pose": "talk"
            }
